    "bestTime": "Any time. It's open until 8pm Monday to Thursday, and curators lead free exhibition tours on Thursdays.",
    "hours": "Reading rooms and galleries: Monday to Thursday 9am to 8pm, Friday 9am to 5pm, weekends 10am to 5pm. The Special Collections area closes at 6pm on weekdays and all day Sunday. Closed Christmas Day.",
