      "Bottled water only: no food or other drinks in the reading rooms",
      "Your phone for the free Bloomberg Connects audio guide"
    ],
    "facilities": [
      "Toilets in both buildings and a baby change room",
      "Library Café (weekdays 8am–5pm, weekends 9:30am–5pm) and the Library Shop",
      "Lockers: $1 per 4 hours with the Yellowbox app or the kiosk, free for members",
      "Free wi-fi; the rooftop Library Bar opens Wednesday to Saturday from 4pm"
    ],
    "access": "Entrances are wheelchair and pram friendly and lifts reach every level. A courtesy wheelchair is kept at the Mitchell vestibule. Accessible toilets are on the Mitchell ground floor and three levels of the Macquarie St building. Hearing loops in the auditorium, Dixson Room and Bashir Reading Room desks.",
    "safety": [
      "Bags can't go into the Special Collections area: use a locker"
    ]
  },
